
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Roe Dizo | My Portfolio</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #001f54, #0077b6, #48cae4);
            color: white;
        }

        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 25px 10%;
            background: rgba(0, 20, 60, 0.4);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 25px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #90e0ef;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 25px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #90e0ef;
        }

        .hero {
            min-height: 85vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 55px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: #90e0ef;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .btn {
            background: #90e0ef;
            color: #001f54;
            padding: 14px 30px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        section {
            padding: 70px 10%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        section h2 {
            font-size: 35px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            color: #90e0ef;
        }

        .about, .skills, .contact {
            background: rgba(0, 20, 60, 0.35);
            margin: 25px 8%;
            padding: 45px;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        .about p {
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .skill-list {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .skill {
            background: #caf0f8;
            color: #001f54;
            padding: 15px 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .contact p {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin: 10px;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            background: rgba(0, 20, 60, 0.5);
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 15px;
            }

            nav a {
                margin: 8px;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 38px;
            }

            .about, .skills, .contact {
                margin: 15px;
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo">ROE DIZO.</div>

        <nav>
            <a href="#home">Home</a>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="hero" id="home">
        <h1>Hello, I'm <span>Roe Dizo!</span></h1>
        <p>Welcome to My Personal Portfolio</p>
        <a href="#about" class="btn">Discover More</a>
    </div>

    <section class="about" id="about">
        <h2>About Me</h2>
        <p>
            Hi! My name is Roe Dizo. Welcome to my personal portfolio!
            This website is a simple introduction about myself, my interests,
            my skills, and the things I enjoy learning.
            I believe that every experience is an opportunity to grow,
            improve, and become a better version of myself.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="skills" id="skills">
        <h2>My Skills</h2>
        <div class="skill-list">
            <div class="skill">Communication</div>
            <div class="skill">Creativity</div>
            <div class="skill">Teamwork</div>
            <div class="skill">Problem Solving</div>
            <div class="skill">Basic HTML</div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="contact">
        <h2>Contact Me</h2>
        <p>Name: Roe Dizo</p>
        <p>Email: Your Email Here</p>
        <p>Thank you for visiting my portfolio!</p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 Roe Dizo | My Personal Portfolio</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
